{"id": "t096-001", "text": "Damian is coeliac, properly strict about it, not just avoiding bread. Worth remembering before the team lunch on May 14.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "team lunch", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-002", "text": "Owen lives in Leeds now, in a flat above a bike shop near the station. His sister Ana is still in Bristol.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat above a bike shop near the station", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Bristol", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}]}
