{"id": "t096-007", "text": "Kate mentioned she's started knitting again after about five years off. She's making a blanket for her niece, chunky cream wool with a cable pattern, and wants to try Fair Isle colourwork next. She swears by the yarn from that little shop on Albert Road and hates the acrylic stuff from the big craft chains. A nice skein from there would go down really well for her birthday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "knitting", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after about five years off"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fair Isle colourwork", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "yarn from that little shop on Albert Road", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates the acrylic stuff from the big craft chains", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nice skein from there would go down really well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}]}
