{"id": "t096-017", "text": "Hiroshi lives in Kyoto at the moment, in a tiny old townhouse near the river, but he's moving to Osaka on March 15th because his company is merging two offices. He's not thrilled about it. His girlfriend Rana is staying in Kyoto for now, so they'll be doing weekends. He says his cat Mochi already hates the carrier, so the train journey should be fun.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Kyoto", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "tiny old townhouse near the river", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Osaka", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 15th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "staying in Kyoto", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
