{"id": "t096-021", "text": "Mehmet's favourite thing is proper Turkish tea, strong, in the little tulip glasses, with two sugar cubes. He thinks English breakfast tea is basically dishwater. He also loves pistachio baklava but only from the bakery in Green Lanes, and he doesn't eat pork. His wife Magda is the opposite and drinks about six cans of Diet Coke a day.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "proper Turkish tea, strong, in the little tulip glasses, with two sugar cubes", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinks English breakfast tea is basically dishwater", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pistachio baklava", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't eat pork", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "drinks about six cans of Diet Coke a day", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t096-022", "text": "Emily works as a nurse at St James's, on the children's ward, mostly nights. She lives in Headingley with two flatmates and her boyfriend lives in Harrogate. Her parents are in Cornwall and her older sister Fiona is a teacher in Exeter with three kids of her own. She says she's the only one in the family who left the south west.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works as a nurse at St James's, on the children's ward, mostly nights", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Headingley with two flatmates", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Harrogate", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Cornwall", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "older sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "teacher", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "only one in the family who left the south west", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
