{"id": "t096-030", "text": "Kate can't eat dairy, but she's fine with goat's cheese. Odd, but good to know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't eat dairy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine with goat's cheese", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}]}
{"id": "t096-031", "text": "Shira plays the cello in a community orchestra. They have a concert on November 8th at 7:30 at St Mary's, and she's playing a short solo. She said she hasn't slept properly in a week thinking about it. I'd like to go if I'm free, and I should text her good luck that afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "cello", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "concert", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 8th at 7:30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "go", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "that afternoon", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-032", "text": "Finally sorted my own plans for half term. I'm driving up to my aunt's on the 24th and coming back the following Sunday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "half term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 24th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the following Sunday evening", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-033", "text": "Damian's wife Petra is pregnant again, due around April 2nd. Their eldest, Leo, is apparently thrilled about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "around April 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled about being a big brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t096-034", "text": "Caitlin is a massive board game person. Wingspan, Terraforming Mars, Spirit Island, anything with lots of little wooden pieces and a rulebook the size of a phone book. She runs a games night every other Thursday at her flat and keeps a spreadsheet of who has won what. Her husband Thabo only plays Catan and gets furious when he loses. She's been eyeing the new Wingspan expansion.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Caitlin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "board game", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Wingspan", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Terraforming Mars", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Spirit Island", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i5", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "anything with lots of little wooden pieces and a rulebook the size of a phone book", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a games night", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every other Thursday"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "keeps a spreadsheet of who has won what", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i6", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Catan", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "gets furious when he loses", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing the new Wingspan expansion", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t096-035", "text": "Salma told me her son Yusuf starts secondary school on September 4th and is dreading the bus journey. Remind me to message her that evening to see how his first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Salma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yusuf", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "secondary school", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 4th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading the bus journey", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that evening", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t096-036", "text": "Tunde Brennan from accounts is retiring on December 15. There's leaving drinks the same day at 5pm at the Crown.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde Brennan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "accounts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 15", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the same day at 5pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t096-037", "text": "Thabo lives in Cape Town but works remotely for a Dutch company. His parents live in Durban.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Cape Town", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works remotely for a Dutch company", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "live in Durban", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t096-038", "text": "Rana doesn't drink alcohol at all, so get some of the nice elderflower stuff for the barbecue on the 27th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rana", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink alcohol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get some of the nice elderflower stuff", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "barbecue", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 27th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-039", "text": "Called Fiona tonight. Her dad has been in hospital since last Wednesday with pneumonia, and she's exhausted from driving back and forth. They're hoping he'll be discharged by Friday morning. I need to ring her again on Sunday, and maybe drop off some food at hers this weekend so she doesn't have to cook.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since last Wednesday"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "pneumonia", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "exhausted from driving back and forth", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "discharged", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop off some food at hers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-040", "text": "Ximena's daughter Lola, who everyone calls Lolita, had her ballet exam on Saturday. Must remember to ask how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ximena", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lola", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lolita", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ballet exam", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how it went", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t096-041", "text": "Ana said she's started climbing at the bouldering wall near her office. She goes three times a week and is already on the blue routes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "climbing", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "goes three times a week", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t096-042", "text": "Yaw's wedding in Accra was cancelled. They've decided to do a small registry office thing in London instead, sometime in the spring.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yaw", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "small registry office thing in London", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the spring", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t096-043", "text": "Hiroshi is a huge fan of Studio Ghibli and has a shelf of Totoro figures. He also plays the shamisen, which I didn't know.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hiroshi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Studio Ghibli", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has a shelf of Totoro figures", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "shamisen", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-044", "text": "Gym, then groceries. Need eggs, spinach, and something for Thursday's dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Gym", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "groceries", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "eggs, spinach, and something for Thursday's dinner", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t096-045", "text": "Jamal's wife Adaeze is a GP at a practice in Salford, and they live in Eccles with their two boys, who are seven and ten. Jamal himself works in IT for the university. His brother is a pilot for some airline in Dubai, and his mum lives with them part of the year. Adaeze's family is mostly in Lagos.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "GP", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "live in Eccles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boys", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "seven and ten", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jamal", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in IT for the university", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "pilot", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives with them part of the year", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f8", "type": "FACT", "text": "mostly in Lagos", "owner": "r4", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t096-046", "text": "Remind me to ask Emily if she wants to come to the gig on 11/2. She loves Fontaines D.C.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Emily if she wants to come to the gig", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Emily", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "gig", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/2", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Fontaines D.C.", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-047", "text": "Mehmet Kaur's daughter has her first violin recital next Friday at 6pm. He's prouder than she is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mehmet Kaur", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first violin recital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday at 6pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "prouder than she is", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t096-048", "text": "Tendai mentioned that Magda's husband passed away last month. The funeral was quiet. I should send Magda a note this week, nothing elaborate.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tendai", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Magda a note", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Magda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t096-049", "text": "Michael and his partner Graham are moving to Brighton on June 30th, which I didn't expect at all. The removal van comes at 8am that morning. Michael has already found a job at a design studio there, starting Monday July 7, and Graham will keep working remotely. Remind me to text Michael on the 7th to see how the first day went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Brighton", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 30th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8am that morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at a design studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday July 7", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "working remotely", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Michael", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t096-050", "text": "Lwazi only eats halal meat and doesn't like spicy food at all, even mild curries are too much for him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats halal meat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't like spicy food", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}]}
{"id": "t096-051", "text": "Petra is a structural engineer at a firm in Manchester. She grew up in Prague and her family still lives there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Petra", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "structural engineer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "grew up in Prague", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives there", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t096-052", "text": "Joseph is training for the Berlin marathon on September 27th. He's doing long runs every Sunday morning and says his left knee is starting to complain. Don't forget to ask how the eighteen-miler went this weekend, and send him a good luck message on the 26th.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joseph", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Berlin marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every Sunday morning"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "left knee is starting to complain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how the eighteen-miler went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eighteen-miler", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a good luck message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 26th", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t096-053", "text": "Lunch with Lior went well. He's into fermenting things now: kimchi, sauerkraut, hot sauce. He promised me a jar of the hot sauce.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fermenting things", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "kimchi", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sauerkraut", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "hot sauce", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t096-054", "text": "Kate's brother Jonah is getting married on August 9th in Galway. She's a bridesmaid and has the hen do on July 19.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kate", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jonah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting married", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "bridesmaid", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hen do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 19", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t096-055", "text": "Carmen and Owen have a new kitten called Pepper. Carmen sent me about thirty photos this morning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new kitten called Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}]}
{"id": "t096-056", "text": "Ava is learning Portuguese on Duolingo because her partner's family is from Porto. She has a 200-day streak and is weirdly competitive about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ava", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Portuguese", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Porto", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "weirdly competitive about it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t096-057", "text": "Note: Damian prefers red wine, mostly Rioja, and can't stand anything sweet. Good for Christmas.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Damian", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "red wine", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Rioja", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't stand anything sweet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Christmas"}]}
{"id": "t096-058", "text": "Shira's grandad turns ninety on March 3rd. The family is hiring a hall for a lunch at 1pm, and she's in charge of the cake. She's asked if I can help her bake it the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shira", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns ninety", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "1pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before"}]}
{"id": "t096-059", "text": "Rain all day. Nothing much happened, just tidied the spare room and watched the match.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "all day"}]}
{"id": "t096-060", "text": "Graham's son Owen has had a rough week at uni, homesick and behind on deadlines. Graham's driving down to see him tomorrow afternoon. I must remember to ask Graham on Friday how Owen's getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "son", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down to see him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Graham on Friday how Owen's getting on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Graham", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Owen", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
